---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Terms for work with Mechaiah, a software studio in Sri Lanka. Payments are by bank transfer. Contracts follow Sri Lankan law."
>
  <header class="page-head page-head--copy">
    <p class="kicker">Terms</p>
    <h1>Terms of work.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      These terms cover work you ask {site.name} to do. Last updated 15 November 2026.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="legal">
    <section>
      <h2>The studio</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} is a software development studio in Sri Lanka. Write to
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> about a project or these terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>A request is not the job</h2>
      <p>
        Sending the quotation form, or writing to us, is a request. A quotation is an offer for a particular scope. Work starts when we both agree that scope.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What is included</h2>
      <p>
        Each engagement is written down: what is included, what is left out, and what done means. Something that is not in that scope is not part of the job.
      </p>
      <p>
        When the work is finished, you receive the website or the software, with the access and the notes that go with it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>
        Project payments are made by bank transfer, on the terms written in the quotation or the scope.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        The pages describe the studio and selected work. A page is not a promise that a particular feature, date, or price applies to your project until it is in an agreed scope.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Law</h2>
      <p>
        Contracts with {site.name} are governed by the laws of Sri Lanka.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your information</h2>
      <p>
        How we handle what you send through the form is in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
